  (241, 'cazal-163-241', 'Cazal 163', 'Cazal', 7, 'sunglasses', 'sunglasses:transitions', '163', 'Sunglasses', 'Unisex', 'Aviator Full Frame', 'Acetate', 'Transparent', '012', 'L', 600, 'USD', 'Experience luxury with Cazal 163 Sunglasses.', 'The stylistic originality of the CAZAL eyewear collections has always left ample scope for extravagant interpretations that can only be properly understood in the context of the collection as a whole. A typical example is the style CAZAL 163, which was created as a harmonious counterpart to an existing men''s style (CAZAL 623). The result is truly astounding.', '{"brand":"Cazal","model":"163","colorCode":"012","shape":"Aviator Full Frame","frameType":"Sunglasses","gender":"Unisex","material":"Acetate","size":"L","color":"Transparent"}'::jsonb, '/product/241', 'active', false, true, 157),
