  (248, 'cazal-6020-3-248', 'Cazal 6020/3', 'Cazal', 7, 'sunglasses', 'sunglasses:transitions', '6020/3', 'Sunglasses', 'Unisex', 'Square Full Frame', 'Acetate', 'Black', '001', 'L', 680, 'USD', 'Experience luxury with Cazal 6020/3 Sunglasses.', 'The highlight of this men''s model are metal eye-rings, combined in the bridge with a delicate dual-crosspiece bridge. They are replenished by faceted acetate eye-rings. This creates a spatial depth, to which a long acetate temple adds the masculine look.', '{"brand":"Cazal","model":"6020/3","colorCode":"001","shape":"Square Full Frame","frameType":"Sunglasses","gender":"Unisex","material":"Acetate","size":"L","color":"Black"}'::jsonb, '/product/248', 'active', false, true, 170),
  (250, 'cazal-6033-3-250', 'Cazal 6033/3', 'Cazal', 7, 'sunglasses', 'sunglasses:transitions', '6033/3', 'Sunglasses', 'Unisex', 'Square Full Frame', 'Titanium', 'Gold', '001', 'XL', 680, 'USD', 'Experience luxury with Cazal 6033/3 Sunglasses.', 'This is a brand new unworn authentic Cazal Sunglasses. Model 6033/3', '{"brand":"Cazal","model":"6033/3","colorCode":"001","shape":"Square Full Frame","frameType":"Sunglasses","gender":"Unisex","material":"Titanium","size":"XL","color":"Gold"}'::jsonb, '/product/250', 'active', false, true, 171),
  (251, 'cazal-607-251', 'Cazal 607', 'Cazal', 7, 'optical', 'optical:transitions', '607', 'Optical', 'Unisex', 'Square Full Frame', 'Acetate', 'Black', '001', 'M', 650, 'USD', 'Experience luxury with Cazal 607 Optical.', 'The key for CAZAL was to design spectacles made of 10-mm thick acetate, a material whose processing is entrusted to only a few. The preferred colours of the iconic “607” are black, havana and crystal, sporadically transparent smoke grey as well. The “607”, also lovingly known in America as “Cazzy”, has become one of the most prominent and best-selling CAZAL collection classics.', '{"brand":"Cazal","model":"607","colorCode":"001","shape":"Square Full Frame","frameType":"Optical","gender":"Unisex","material":"Acetate","size":"M","color":"Black"}'::jsonb, '/product/251', 'active', false, true, 165),
