  (263, 'cazal-7074-263', 'Cazal 7074', 'Cazal', 7, 'optical', 'optical:transitions', '7074', 'Optical', 'Male', 'Square', 'Acetate', 'Black', '004', 'L', 550, 'USD', 'Experience luxury with Cazal 7074 Optical.', 'The CAZAL 7074 has not only one but two origins. Though introduced as early as the late 1970s, this style reached full iconic status in 1984 – and has maintained it ever since. CAZAL wanted to create a corrective eyeglasses frame made of 10-mm-strong acetate. Only very few manufacturers at the time dared use that material.', '{"brand":"Cazal","model":"7074","colorCode":"004","shape":"Square","frameType":"Optical","gender":"Male","material":"Acetate","size":"L","color":"Black"}'::jsonb, '/product/263', 'active', false, true, 155),
  (265, 'cazal-7077-265', 'Cazal 7077', 'Cazal', 7, 'optical', 'optical:transitions', '7077', 'Optical', 'Male', 'Aviator Full Frame', 'Titanium', 'Black', '001', 'XL', 450, 'USD', 'Experience luxury with Cazal 7077 Optical.', 'Cazal 7077 Eyeglasses made by Cazal are Men''s Eyeglasses. They have a Square shape, and come in 3 colors, which are BI-COLOR, BLACK-GOLD, and BLACK-SILVER with size 6013-145.', '{"brand":"Cazal","model":"7077","colorCode":"001","shape":"Aviator Full Frame","frameType":"Optical","gender":"Male","material":"Titanium","size":"XL","color":"Black"}'::jsonb, '/product/265', 'active', false, true, 30),
  (269, 'cazal-742-269', 'Cazal 742', 'Cazal', 7, 'optical', 'optical:transitions', '742', 'Optical', 'Male', 'Aviator', 'Titanium', 'Gold', '097', 'L', 615, 'USD', 'Experience luxury with Cazal 742 Optical.', 'Bold, unique, asymmetrical and iconic, the Cazal Eyeglasses are truly remarkable. The Cazal 742 eyeglasses are a cool and eccentric way to address your vision needs. The unusual Square shape of the Cazal frames are the real deal. However, they are made from the finest Metal to compliment the looks with strength. These Cazal glasses feature these curved and non-slip temples that will provide steadiness. The hinges, on the other hand, will allow a flexible and nice fit. Best for Unisex, these eyeglasses are available in different colors, including the iconic Black Gold .', '{"brand":"Cazal","model":"742","colorCode":"097","shape":"Aviator","frameType":"Optical","gender":"Male","material":"Titanium","size":"L","color":"Gold"}'::jsonb, '/product/269', 'active', false, true, 159),
