  ('dc2a99a9-5f36-6210-ebf5-87da6db3950b', 5294, 'Dunhill DU0084S', 'Aviator', 'Sunglasses', 'Metal', 'Gunmetal', '004', '/mirror-assets/9c69901164c07775.png', 'Dunhill DU0084S', 405, 'USD', 'The Harness collection is a modern tribute to Dunhill''s rich heritage in equestrian craftsmanship. Metal plaque profiles’ peculiar for this line are recalled on Eyewear details. A pilot shape with the Harness Hardware used as Eyewear Structure on the bridge.', 53),
  ('2509e598-7aac-8e75-e428-eced11d74563', 5314, 'Dunhill DU0095OA', 'Square', 'Optical', 'Recycled Acetate', 'Grey', '008', '/mirror-assets/3e7a22c429e06d5e.png', 'Dunhill DU0095OA', 340, 'USD', 'THIN ACETATE CONSTRUCTION IN A SOFT SQUARED SHAPE. STYLE ENRICHED BY SIGNATURE PLAQUE ON BOTH TEMPLES.', 45),
  ('a9a2484e-04ad-f8eb-6856-87be76797099', 5331, 'Dunhill DU0049OA', 'Square', 'Optical', 'Recycled Acetate', 'Black', '005', '/mirror-assets/22b4210e1303ab7d.png', 'Dunhill DU0049OA', 340, 'USD', 'Signature Plaque styles are characterized by a vintage, classic and masculine design, enriched with the iconic Dunhill Logo on the temples. Rectangular shape with a masculine and sophisticated statement. Temples feature the House logo on a tiny plaque. The masculine color palette includes both shiny classic tones and transparent sophisticated ones.', 26),
  ('a8313858-da10-554c-d314-2f37d5b91cc4', 5454, 'Dolce&Gabbana DG4542', 'Square', 'Sunglasses', 'Acetate', 'Blue', '348280', '/mirror-assets/bafc538d0e0c442c.png', 'Dolce&Gabbana DG4542', 297, 'USD', 'The Dolce&Gabbana DG4542 is a tribute to modern elegance — clean lines, luxurious materials, and a fit engineered for all-day wearability.', 64),
  ('314c59fe-872d-52ce-d1a1-9a3e8cc28440', 5475, 'Dolce&Gabbana DG5076', 'Cat-Eye', 'Optical', 'Nylon', 'Black', '501', '/mirror-assets/830e9efa24cf7424.png', 'Dolce&Gabbana DG5076', 277, 'USD', 'Designed for confident self-expression, the Dolce&Gabbana DG5076 pairs a distinctive shape with high-quality construction for lasting comfort and impact.', 43),
  ('5a93d691-2f4f-448d-98c5-8ba56c0f794d', 5581, 'Dolce&Gabbana DG5066', 'Square', 'Optical', 'Nylon', 'Black', '501', '/mirror-assets/57a22cfaed1fc25a.png', 'Dolce&Gabbana DG5066', 277, 'USD', 'Elevate your look with the Dolce&Gabbana DG5066, a frame that combines bold character with the heritage craftsmanship synonymous with the Dolce&Gabbana name.', 23),
  ('abca2c71-a045-303b-bfca-ec1f63a3659d', 5584, 'Dolce&Gabbana DG6165', 'Square', 'Sunglasses', 'Nylon', 'Black', '501/87', '/mirror-assets/2df40f10dd56aac3.png', 'Dolce&Gabbana DG6165', 292, 'USD', 'A perfect blend of fashion and function, the Dolce&Gabbana DG6165 delivers iconic styling with the comfort and durability you expect from Dolce&Gabbana.', 52),
  ('71744cbd-7978-cc9b-99d9-33fbe0311b02', 5797, 'Maybach The General I', 'Classic', 'Sunglasses', null, 'Black', 'MM-GNL01BP-ABZ66-6112', '/mirror-assets/0fd4443e09ae78cc.png', 'Maybach The General I', 1800, 'USD', null, 4),
  ('327f6e30-eddc-2935-6ab6-ac39f8e90a18', 5801, 'Maybach The King I', 'Classic', 'Sunglasses', null, 'Champagne Gold', 'MM-Ki01CHG-HEZ35-6312', '/mirror-assets/af7cc862f563bc0a.png', 'Maybach The King I', 3135, 'USD', 'This frame presents a detailed “floating lens” construction and elaborate topbar with MAYBACH embossing. Miniature MAYBACH Double-M logos decorate the screw heads, adding a unique touch to the striking lens shape with lasered detailing. Special elements to delight the true connoisseur, such as the MAYBACH brogue pattern and “flowing lines” – just wait to be discovered. Handcrafted temples in fine wood or natural horn introduce an open décor inspired by the latest styling of the famous automobile interior.', 5),
  ('2561fe7b-4737-04b0-ba4a-d32063811edd', 5923, 'Dita Monolix', 'Square', 'Sunglasses', 'Acetate', 'Transparent', 'DTS750-A-02', '/mirror-assets/0dc9ace91a622511.png', 'Dita Monolix', 595, 'USD', null, 134),
